The '''Elegant Letter''' is provided as an objective for {{questlong|Alliance|1|Elegant Letter (quest)|Elegant Letter|race=HighElf|class=paladin}}.

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
Light be with you, aspirant. I am Lor'thas, a Paladin, like yourself. I write this letter to inform you of my presence in the academy and to offer you advice and training. You are surely aware of our new condition that, sadly, cannot be prevented. However, we may prolong its inevitable onset.

The Light offers us discipline and salvation, though what we truly seek is redemption and justice. Under its brightness, the Light shall provide us a chance to repay the Scourge a debt long overdue. You shall find me on the lower level of the main building.
}}

